      "/parameters/3/schema/properties/rates/properties/plus/properties/adultDailyMinor": "每名成人每日费用，单位为人民币分，允许为零。",
      "/parameters/3/schema/properties/rates/properties/plus/properties/childDailyMinor": "每名儿童每日费用，单位为人民币分，允许为零。"
